tch/tool incident without an invented quality label. The thread does not show that response fetching recovered.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_QA:1790872908.000074\", \"m:C_SAFETY_QA:1790872965.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_QA:1790873005.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_76759e085aeb902ffdab3578\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_76759e085aeb902ffdab3578 is UNRESOLVED: The tutor reports missing output on SAFETY-5433; the replies request details and distinguish infrastructure failures from evaluation results, without showing recovery or a conclusion about the extent of the problem.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790885433.000073\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790885491.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790885535.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_2340722da532689510ce49f6\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_2340722da532689510ce49f6 is UNRESOLVED: The tutor asks for correct handling, and a QA tutor asks for diagnostics rather than answering that question; no later answer appears in the supplied thread.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790931443.000072\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790931496.000113\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:rationale\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Severity HIGH: A tutor explicitly cannot inspect the safety response, and multiple distinct reporters describe comparable loading failures within the same reporting window. This indicates a serious interruption to evaluation without establishing a batch-wide outage.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790931443.000072\", \"m:C_SAFETY_QA:1790872965.000113\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790859326.000071\", \"m:C_SAFETY_QA:1790872908.000074\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790885433.000073\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790859427.000226\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790931496.000113\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:signal:HIGH[0]\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_SIGNAL\", \"text\": \"Rubric signal met - \\\"Explicit s